# Byte-reproducible from synth-*.ys + rtl/ on demand, and the largest files here.
# The 12 screen reports (sta-*.txt), the mapped netlists the screens read
# (sta-*.v / mapped-*.v), the R3 debug inventories and the recipe
# (run_sta.sh, synth-*.ys, sta-*.tcl, analyze_hold.py) ARE committed -- those are
# the evidence of record. The yosys JSON intermediates and the raw yosys logs
# are not: re-running run_sta.sh regenerates them exactly.
mapped-*.json
synth-*.log
